                <pb facs="0710" n="676" xml:id="pg676"/>

                <head>302. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On November 4, the National Security Council approved NSC 5910/1, “U.S. Policy on
                    France,” which contained a section on “The Algerian Problem.” Paragraph 42c
                    defined policy guidance on Algeria. NSC 5910/1 is scheduled for publication in
                        <ref target="frus:frus1958-60v07p1">volume VII</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
